cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EasyResearch in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "EasyResearch: Machine Learning without Programming"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hassanat
    given-names: Ahmad B. A.
    email: ahmad.hassanat@gmail.com
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-11
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ahmadhassant/easyresearch"
url: "https://github.com/ahmadhassant/easyresearch"
abstract: >-
  EasyResearch provides analysis cores for regression, time-series
  forecasting and signal classification, and a Windows desktop application
  that runs these tasks and EasyClassifier's classification without code.
  Every step that learns from data uses training data only, models keep their
  published defaults with fixed seeds, the selected model receives a separate
  final score, forecasts are never evaluated on shuffled data, and every run
  writes a report with a Methods paragraph and the references for every
  method used.
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - regression
  - time-series forecasting
  - time-series classification
  - no-code
  - reproducibility
  - Hassanat distance
references:
